# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the value. `.env` is gitignored.
# Never commit a real key. Git history is permanent: a key that is
# committed once must be treated as burned and rotated, even if the
# commit is later removed.

# The signing key for `crates/ask-harness`, as a 0x-prefixed 32-byte
# hex string.
#
# TESTNET ONLY. The harness asserts chainId 84532 (Base Sepolia) before
# it signs and refuses every other chain, so this key must be a Base
# Sepolia key holding testnet funds only. Never put a mainnet key here.
#
# The harness reads this variable at run time and never writes it to
# disk, to the response cache, or to a log line. Leave it empty and
# `cargo run -p ask-harness -- dry-run` still works: a dry run signs
# with a published test vector, sends no request, and spends nothing.
ASK_HARNESS_PRIVATE_KEY=
